---
title: Sidecar
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, brandy]
source: Our own
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @cognac{2%fl_oz}, @triple sec{1%fl_oz}, and @lemon juice{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled, with a sugared rim). Garnish with a @lemon{1%wedge}.

> use a good quality cognac or brandy. Cointreau is preferred for triple sec.
